      "side": "Spanish",
      "summary": "Cuesta's half-trained levies, posted apart from Blake's army, came forward too late to save it and were broken in their turn by Mouton's division, the Leon volunteers and the guardsmen of the Garde du Corps fighting hardest.",
      "notes": [
        "After Nafziger: about 10,000 infantry and 560 cavalry, with no guns. The volunteers and tercios, newly raised, are shown as Militia.",
